---
import FeatureScope from './FeatureScope.astro';
import HouseComparison from './HouseComparison.astro';
import { focused, focusedEmail } from '../../lib/proposals/wheeler-focused';
import { money } from '../../lib/proposals/wheeler';
---
<section class="ambition wrap" aria-labelledby="focused-ambition">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">A focused start / September 2026</p><h1 id="focused-ambition">Make Wheeler the go-to brand for residential steel construction.</h1><p class="focused-lead">Start with LA builders and general contractors.</p><p class="ambition-note">Build on the work already in place. Turn Wheeler’s expertise into visible authority, then activate targeted outreach and learn what deserves more investment.</p><div class="market-path"><span>Build authority</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Reach builders</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Scale what works</span></div></div>
  <HouseComparison />
</section>
<section class="audiences wrap" aria-labelledby="focused-audiences"><h2 id="focused-audiences">Builders first. A wider opportunity follows.</h2><div class="audience-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Primary / Builders + GCs</p><h3>A compelling reason to choose Wheeler.</h3><ul class="audience-points"><li>Project economics and construction advantages</li><li>Design flexibility and customization</li><li>Clear differentiation from panelization</li></ul><p class="funnel-outcome">One GTM funnel focused on qualified builder conversations in LA.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Supporting / Homeowners + architects</p><h3>Build confidence around every project.</h3><ul class="audience-points"><li>Show the homes and outcomes steel makes possible</li><li>Reuse project material and approved expert knowledge</li><li>Reach homeowners from day one with optional Instagram support</li></ul><p class="funnel-outcome">Reinforce credibility while the initial acquisition effort focuses on builders.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="intro wrap" id="focused-plans"><p class="eyebrow">Your investment</p><h2>A focused engagement. Room to grow.</h2><p>Hands-on execution from Miguel, with optional designer support.</p></section>
<div class="focused-pricing wrap">
  <article class="plan focused-core" aria-labelledby="focused-plan-name"><div class="plan-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Authority + builder acquisition</p><h2 id="focused-plan-name">{focused.name}</h2><p class="price">{money(focused.price)}<span> / month</span></p><p class="description">Build Wheeler’s authority and operate a focused path to builder conversations.</p><p class="term">Initial 3-month engagement. Setup included.</p></div><div class="plan-inclusions"><h3>GTM agents + hands-on execution:</h3><ul>{focused.features.map((feature,index)=><li><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><FeatureScope feature={feature} id={`focused-scope-${index}`} />{feature.detail && <p>{feature.detail}</p>}{feature.items && <ul class="agent-sublist">{feature.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul>}</div></li>)}</ul></div></article>
  <aside class="focused-side">
    <section class="instagram-addon" aria-labelledby="instagram-title"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@11/icons/instagram.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" /><p class="eyebrow">Optional add-on</p><h2 id="instagram-title">Instagram</h2><p class="price">+{money(focused.instagramPrice)}<span> / month</span></p><p>Build homeowner awareness from day one through project visuals, design, customization and supported resilience benefits.</p><ul>{focused.instagram.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p class="addon-responsibility">Stacie supplies the source content and approvals. Miguel coordinates design and publishing.</p><label class="addon-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="instagram-addon" /> <span>Add Instagram</span></label></section>
    <section class="focused-investment" aria-labelledby="investment-title"><p class="eyebrow" id="investment-title">Your selected engagement</p><div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p id="focused-selection-label">Core engagement</p><p class="price"><span id="focused-total" class="total-number">{money(focused.price)}</span><span> / month</span></p></div><p>Initial 3-month engagement.<br />Software and other costs separate.</p><a class="discuss-engagement" id="focused-contact" href={focusedEmail(false)} data-core-href={focusedEmail(false)} data-instagram-href={focusedEmail(true)} data-core-price={money(focused.price)} data-instagram-price={money(focused.price+focused.instagramPrice)}>Discuss this engagement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>Explore your options. Nothing is submitted or accepted here.</small></section>
  </aside>
</div>
<section class="wrap focused-roadmap" aria-labelledby="focused-roadmap-title"><p class="eyebrow">The first 90 days</p><h2 id="focused-roadmap-title">Set up properly. Activate. Improve.</h2><p class="roadmap-intro">Complete what is missing and connect what already works. We build on Wheeler’s existing systems, content and expertise.</p><div class="focused-months">{focused.months.map((month,index)=><article><p class="eyebrow">Month 0{index+1}</p><h3>{month.title}</h3><p>{month.purpose}</p><ul>{month.items.map(item=><li>{typeof item==='string' ? item : <>{item.text}<ul class="roadmap-agent-list">{item.agents.map(agent=><li><span class="roadmap-inline-logos" aria-hidden="true">{agent.logos.map(logo=><img src={logo.src} width="16" height="16" alt="" />)}</span>{agent.text}</li>)}</ul></>}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div><p class="involvement">Planned sequencing from kickoff, dependent on access, approved material and channel readiness. Rankings and lead volumes are not guaranteed.</p></section>
<section class="wrap focused-operations" aria-labelledby="focused-delivery-title"><h2 id="focused-delivery-title">Clear ownership. Visible progress.</h2><p class="roadmap-intro">I work with a maximum of five clients at a time, staying hands-on with execution and focused on measurable business results.</p><div class="focused-operation-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Miguel operates</p><p>Messaging, foundation setup, the website editorial calendar, agent publishing and outreach, optimization and reporting. One monthly review with concise written progress updates.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Wheeler contributes</p><p>Access, approved technical and project material, audience input and timely approvals. Wheeler owns sales response, qualification, quotes and closing.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">What we measure</p><p>Working tracking, published content and active outreach first. Then qualified builder conversations, meetings, quotes and attributable pipeline, using available data and Wheeler’s sales feedback. Numeric targets follow the baseline.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="wrap notes" aria-label="Focused engagement terms"><p>USD, billed monthly in advance, with an initial 3-month engagement. Setup included. Month-to-month afterward with 30 days’ notice.</p><p>Software, travel and applicable taxes are additional. Paid-media management and advertising spend are excluded. Extensive redevelopment, CRM migration, major shoots and additional channels require separate scope. Delivery follows agreed priorities and shared capacity.</p><p>Instagram targets homeowners from the start, with design and publishing using supplied material. Original filming and ongoing inbox or community management are excluded. Selected options are finalized in the agreement.</p></section>
